Today is Thursday.
It is afternoon.
Rohan and I are in the office.
We drink coffee and chat.
Rohan asks me about my free time.
He says, "Maya, do you go to the gym in the evening?"
I say, "I go to the gym on Tuesdays and Thursdays."
"But I like to meet new people."
"I like to play badminton a lot."
Rohan asks, "Do you know how to play badminton?"
I laugh and say, "Yes, I can play very well."
Rohan says, "There is a badminton club nearby."
"Many people come there to play."
I like this idea a lot.
I make a decision.
I do not go to the gym on Thursdays now.
I tell Rohan, "I go there to play badminton every Thursday now."
I am very happy about this new schedule.
